•	Europe – Focuses on automotive and industrial power electronics, with a regulatory environment that rewards low carbon materials and recyclable substrate solutions.
•	Latin America – Scaling assembly operations drive demand for cost effective base materials, though high performance offerings remain imported.
•	Middle East & Africa – Emerging markets with growing telecom infrastructure demand ruggedized packaging, while investment in local fabrication plants promises future shifts toward regional sourcing.
